#: includes/famefe-admin.php:673
msgid "All regular members of the period together pay the base fee times their number (the expected total). Each member’s share of the volunteer hours of all regular members lowers the fee; what is collected above the expected total is taken off everybody equally, and no fee goes below zero. A member without any hours in the period always pays twice the base fee. Honorary members pay nothing. With the optional discount, the given share of members with the lowest fees pays the given percentage less, or as much less as needed for the given total to collect; nothing is moved to the others."
msgstr "Alle almindelige medlemmer i perioden betaler tilsammen grundkontingentet gange deres antal (den forventede total). Hvert medlems andel af alle almindelige medlemmers frivillige timer sænker dets kontingent; det, der opkræves ud over den forventede total, trækkes ligeligt fra hos alle, og intet kontingent kommer under nul. Et medlem uden timer i perioden betaler altid det dobbelte grundkontingent. Æresmedlemmer betaler intet. Med den valgfri rabat betaler den angivne andel af medlemmer med de laveste kontingenter den angivne procentsats mindre, eller så meget mindre, som der skal til for det angivne samlede beløb at opkræve; intet flyttes over på de andre."

